      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The game Forest Defense is set in a forest area under invasion. Hostile
    creatures press forward toward the depths of the forest along fixed routes, posing
    a threat to the safety of the core defense zone.

    As the enemies draw closer,
    the battle scenes shift gradually from the forest to more essential areas, such
    as ancient relics and stone defensive lines.

    In the game, players take on
    the role of the forest''s guardians, whose primary duty is not to join the battles
    directly, but to stop the enemies'' advance by arranging defensive towers in
    a rational way.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e498d1c8094910479dc3e1b768306a4, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 2e498d1c8094910479dc3e1b768306a4, type: 2}
